  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "dg1_hotaru",
      "name": "Hotaru",
      "title": "<Root-Lantern Spirit>",
      "sprite": "npc_spirit",
      "portrait": "portrait_spirit",
      "dialogue": "dlg_dg1_hotaru",
      "bark": "*A tiny paper-lantern spirit bobs among the mushrooms, glowing honey-gold.*",
      "shortName": "Hotaru"
    }
  ],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "dlg_dg1_hotaru",
      "start": "o_done",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "o_done",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Listen — can you hear it? The roots are singing the right note again. The Rootwarden's asleep by the Root Lantern, snoring like a happy hillside. Thank you. Kusu thanks you too. He's just slow about it.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "QuestComplete", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu"}],
          "fallback": "o_elder",
          "choices": [{"text": "Goodbye."}]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_elder",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Has your Elder seen the seed yet? Don't keep it near anything that grows. Or anything that sleeps. Or me.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "QuestState", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu", "value": "elder"}],
          "fallback": "o_return",
          "choices": [{"text": "I'm on my way."}]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_return",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "*Hotaru's lantern-head flares bright as noon.* You did it! I can feel him — he's sleeping, properly sleeping, for the first time in a year. And that... that's the seed.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "QuestState", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu", "value": "hotaru"}],
          "fallback": "o_active",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Here it is. What should I do with it?",
              "next": "o_return2",
              "conditions": [{"type": "HasItem", "key": "dg1_ash_seed", "amount": 1}]
            },
            {"text": "I'll come back with it.", "conditions": [{"type": "NotHasItem", "key": "dg1_ash_seed", "amount": 1}]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_return2",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Don't give it to ME! *She bobs backwards three feet.* Take it to someone who knows what to do with grey things. Your Elder, under the tree — she's been talking to Kusu longer than anyone alive. And it isn't from here, that seed. It smells of somewhere cold and very far away, where something enormous is burning in its sleep.",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg1_hotaru_told"}],
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Sleep well, old guardian.",
              "check": {"skill": "Religion", "dc": 12, "success": "o_bless_s", "failure": "o_bless_f"},
              "once": true,
              "tag": "RELIGION"
            },
            {"text": "I'll take it to Elder Maru.", "next": "o_return3"}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_bless_s",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "*Somewhere deep in the dark a great slow breath goes out, and every spirit-lantern in the grove burns a little warmer.* He heard you.",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "GiveXP", "amount": 50}],
          "next": "o_return3"
        },
        {
          "id": "o_bless_f",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "*Nothing answers but the drip of water. Hotaru pats your arm.* He's very deeply asleep. That's good, really.",
          "next": "o_return3"
        },
        {
          "id": "o_return3",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Go on, up into the light. And the old lamplighters left a little something by the Root Lantern, for whoever tended it. That's you, now. Sort of. Honorary.",
          "choices": [{"text": "Goodbye, Hotaru."}]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_active",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "He's past the two Sentinels, in the deepest hollow. Be kind if you can. Be quick if you can't. And mind the seed when it blooms — it makes the whole hollow go grey.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "QuestState", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu", "value": "warden"}],
          "fallback": "o_greet",
          "choices": [{"text": "Goodbye."}]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_greet",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "*A small spirit with a paper lantern for a head bobs out from behind a mushroom, glowing the colour of honey.* Oh! A person. A real one, with feet! I'm Hotaru. I tend the Root Lantern. Well. I tended it. Before.",
          "choices": [
            {"text": "Before what? What happened down here?", "next": "o_story"},
            {
              "text": "The light down here is wrong. Something is draining it.",
              "check": {"skill": "Arcana", "dc": 13, "success": "o_arc_s", "failure": "o_arc_f"},
              "once": true,
              "tag": "ARCANA"
            },
            {"text": "Goodbye."}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_arc_s",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "*Her light flickers in surprise.* You can see it? Yes — it's being drunk, a little every night, by something that isn't from here. Clever person. Listen, then.",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "GiveXP", "amount": 40}],
          "next": "o_story"
        },
        {
          "id": "o_arc_f",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Wrong? It's MOSS light. It's meant to be greenish. *She looks a little offended, then a little worried.* ...But you're right that something is wrong. Listen.",
          "next": "o_story"
        },
        {
          "id": "o_story",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Last autumn something fell out of the sky and sank through the soil, all the way down to the roots: a seed, grey as ash, cold as a cellar step. Wherever it touched, the roots forgot themselves. So the Rootwarden — Kusu's guardian, big and gentle and terribly slow — swallowed it into his lantern heart, to keep it from the tree.",
          "next": "o_story2"
        },
        {
          "id": "o_story2",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "He's been holding it ever since, and it's been hollowing him out, a little every night. Now he doesn't know me. The rootlings run up into the orchards to get away from him. That singing you heard? That's him, trying to remember the words.",
          "next": "o_offer"
        },
        {
          "id": "o_offer",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Will you free him? Take the seed out of his heart. He can't let go of it by himself — he's too stubborn, and too kind.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "I'll free him.",
              "next": "o_accept",
              "conditions": [{"type": "Level", "amount": 11}, {"type": "QuestNotStarted", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu"}],
              "outcomes": [{"type": "StartQuest", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu"}]
            },
            {"text": "What is this seed?", "next": "o_seed"},
            {"text": "I'm not ready to face him yet."}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_seed",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Grey, and cold, and patient. It came on the wind, from the north — I heard the ash hiss on the leaves the night it fell. The Hollow that came for your lanterns had the same smell. I think it's where the Hollow comes from. I think there are more of them, out there.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "I'll free him.",
              "next": "o_accept",
              "conditions": [{"type": "Level", "amount": 11}, {"type": "QuestNotStarted", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu"}],
              "outcomes": [{"type": "StartQuest", "key": "dg1_heart_of_kusu"}]
            },
            {"text": "I'm not ready to face him yet."}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_accept",
          "speaker": "dg1_hotaru",
          "text": "Thank you. He's past the Sentinels, in the deepest hollow. When the seed blooms the whole hollow goes grey — stand fast, it passes. And if you can, tell him Hotaru's waiting.",
          "choices": [{"text": "Goodbye."}]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "quests": [
    {
